       IDENTIFICATION   DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.      prog.
       PROCEDURE        DIVISION.
           GO TO END-OF-PROGRAM.
           STOP RUN.
])

AT_CHECK([${COMPILE_ONLY} prog.cob], [1], ,
[prog.cob:5: Error: 'END-OF-PROGRAM' undefined
